@TTSFreeUse.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5138

### Is the voice model ready?
GET {{TTSFreeUse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/speech/status

### List voices
GET {{TTSFreeUse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/speech/voices

### Speak a short piece of text (returns WAV)
POST {{TTSFreeUse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/speech/text
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Hello! This is free, offline text to speech.", "voice": "bf_emma", "speed": 1.0 }

### See exactly what the voice will read
POST {{TTSFreeUse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pronunciations/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Install a 20A GFCI per NEC §210.8(A)." }

### Save a document as an MP3 in the background
POST {{TTSFreeUse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="format"

Mp3
--boundary--

### Conversion progress
GET {{TTSFreeUse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
